OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,For drizzle, drier at first in the
OL,7,Feast. Rain becoming more persistent
OL,8,Fand widespread during the afternoon,
OL,9,Fwith some heavy bursts possible.
OL,10,FBreezy, especially along the coast,
OL,11,Fand feeling rather cool.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with rain for much of
OL,14,Fthe night, rain perhaps becoming more
OL,15,Fsporadic towards dawn. Winds easing a
OL,16,Flittle, but still breezy towards the
OL,17,Fcoast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
