OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain throughout, perhaps more patchy
OL,7,Fduring the morning, with a few heavier
OL,8,Fbursts possible in the afternoon.
OL,9,FBecoming largely dry overnight.
OL,10,FBecoming breezy during the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FLargely dry with sunny spells and
OL,14,Flight winds Thursday. Heavy and
OL,15,Fpersistent rain, accompanied by strong
OL,16,Fwinds Friday. Sunny spells and a few
OL,17,Fshowers Saturday, but rain arriving
OL,18,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
